# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Civic Compass — privacy guard
#
# This tool produces, by design, some of the most sensitive files you will ever
# generate: a written record of your political values and your actual ballot.
# In many jurisdictions political opinion is a special/sensitive category of
# personal data. Committing these to a public repo is irreversible — forks,
# caches, and archive scrapers make un-publishing impossible.
#
# Keep these rules in place. If you genuinely intend to publish a charter,
# force-add that one file deliberately (`git add -f`) rather than loosening
# this list.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# --- Your charter and its derivatives -------------------------------------
CHARTER.md
CHARTER.*.md
ABOUT-ME.md
charter/
charters/

# --- Ballot analyses (your actual votes) ----------------------------------
VOTING-GUIDE.md
VOTING-GUIDE.html
VOTING-GUIDE.*
voting-guide*/
ballots/

# --- Ballots and sample ballots you feed in --------------------------------
# A sample ballot can carry a voter stub, precinct, or voter ID; a photo of a
# marked ballot shows how you voted. Registrar filenames are unpredictable
# (SFRA_4_4_3_1.pdf, IMG_4821.jpg), so rather than guess at names, this repo
# ships no PDFs or images of its own and simply ignores all of them.
*.pdf
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.heic
*.gif
*.webp
ballots/
sample-ballot*

# --- Social / writing exports used by /ground-charter ----------------------
# A full X export contains DMs, your phone number, IP + geolocation history,
# private AI chats, block/mute lists, and ad-targeting inferences.
x-archive/
twitter-archive/
twitter-*.zip
x-*.zip
reddit-*.zip
bluesky-*.zip
*-export.zip
data/account.js
data/direct-message*
data/like.js
data/tweets.js
data/ip-audit.js
data/phone-number.js
data/personalization.js
data/grok-chat-item.js

# --- Local agent / editor state (leaks absolute paths, session logs) -------
.claude/settings.local.json
.gstack/
.obsidian/

# --- Secrets ---------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json

# --- Build noise -----------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Re-includes — MUST stay last: git applies the last matching pattern.
# The rules above are deliberately broad, which would otherwise swallow the
# scaffolding this plugin ships (CHARTER.template.md, VOTING-GUIDE.template.md,
# and the fictional example charters). These are not anyone's real data.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
!plugins/civic-compass/templates/
!plugins/civic-compass/templates/**
!plugins/civic-compass/examples/
!plugins/civic-compass/examples/**
